:name: ZB-04 DoS diagnostic — locate the LIVE vector table (VTOR) and confirm 0xE436 is the fault handler
:description: Reads SCB->VTOR after boot to find the vector table the CPU actually uses at fault time, then reads its HardFault/BusFault/UsageFault entries to confirm the post-pop PC (0xE436) is inside a fault handler pointed to by the live vector table.

using sysbus
emulation SetGlobalSerialExecution true
mach create "zb04"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/boards/silabs/brd4162a.repl
macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF @scripts/silabs-vuln/zb04_aqara.elf
    cpu VectorTableOffset 0x4000
"""
runMacro $reset
logLevel 3

emulation RunFor "0.3"
pause
echo ">>> post-boot PC:"
cpu PC
echo ">>> SCB->VTOR (0xE000ED08) = live vector table base:"
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0xE000ED08
echo ">>> cpu VectorTableOffset property:"
cpu VectorTableOffset
echo ">>> LIVE fault vectors at VTOR=0x4200 (HardFault 0x420C / MemManage / BusFault / UsageFault):"
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x420C
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x4210
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x4214
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x4218
